                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d48c1d51-b6b1-3890-929e-441563468c73",
                        "entry_id": "dd139298-d605-3e67-8dbf-57e66129cafa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "number"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dc1d6a3-b2aa-42a2-a39a-69342626f112",
                                "sense_id": "d48c1d51-b6b1-3890-929e-441563468c73",
                                "text": "Не успе́л Вро́нский посмотре́ть седло́, о кото́ром на́до бы́ло сде́лать распоряже́ние, как ска́чущих позва́ли к бесе́дке для вынима́ния нумеро́в и отправле́ния. С серьёзными, стро́гими, мно́гие с бле́дными ли́цами, семна́дцать челове́к офице́ров сошли́сь к бесе́дке и разобра́ли нумера́. Вро́нскому доста́лся седьмо́й ну́мер. Послы́шалось: «Сади́ться!»",
                                "translation": "Vronsky had not had time to look at the saddle, about which he had to give some direction, when the competitors were summoned to the pavilion to receive their numbers and places in the row at starting. Seventeen officers, looking serious and severe, many with pale faces, met together in the pavilion and drew the numbers. Vronsky drew the number seven. The cry was heard: \"Mount!\"",
                                "english": "Vronsky had not had time to look at the saddle, about which he had to give some direction, when the competitors were summoned to the pavilion to receive their numbers and places in the row at starting. Seventeen officers, looking serious and severe, many with pale faces, met together in the pavilion and drew the numbers. Vronsky drew the number seven. The cry was heard: \"Mount!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2effa35c-117a-36c4-80e3-a90918d62ebc",
                        "entry_id": "dd139298-d605-3e67-8dbf-57e66129cafa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "room (in a hotel)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66b25c0c-7c89-44de-9554-46f30e4b96ef",
                                "sense_id": "2effa35c-117a-36c4-80e3-a90918d62ebc",
                                "text": "Ка́ждое у́тро, поку́да я потя́гиваюсь и пью свой ко́фе, три сту́ка раздаю́тся в дверь моего́ ну́мера.",
                                "translation": "Mikhail Saltykov-Shchedrin",
                                "english": "Mikhail Saltykov-Shchedrin"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
